<h2>Your options</h2>
<ul class="checklist">
  <li><strong>In-office whitening.</strong> A single appointment, supervised, with the strongest professional-grade gel. Results visible immediately.</li>
  <li><strong>Custom take-home trays.</strong> We make trays molded to your teeth, you whiten at home over 1–2 weeks. The trays last for years of touch-ups.</li>
  <li><strong>Combination.</strong> A jump-start in-office plus take-home trays for maintenance — popular for events or weddings.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Before you whiten</h2>
<p>Whitening works best on natural tooth structure. Crowns, veneers, and tooth-colored fillings don't change color. If you have visible restorations in your smile, we'll plan around them so the final result looks even. A cleaning before whitening also helps the gel reach the enamel evenly.</p>
